~ start
Aetherion: I am Aetherion — Warden of the Endless Sky.  
Aetherion: The winds whisper of your strength. Can your logic soar as high?  
[do! get_tree().get_first_node_in_group("player").lock_player()]
[do! DialogueManager.aetherion.face_player()]
=> Q1

~ Q1
Aetherion: The wind travels 5 miles at a 60° angle from east. How far does it drift eastward?  
- A. 2.89 miles => Q1_WRONG
- B. 4.33 miles => Q1_WRONG
- C. 8.66 miles => Q1_CORRECT
- D. 10 miles => Q1_WRONG

~ Q1_CORRECT
Aetherion: Sharp as a gust! [do! DialogueManager.aetherion.trigger_correct_answer()]
=> Q2

~ Q1_WRONG
Aetherion: Your compass spins wrongly. [do! DialogueManager.aetherion.trigger_wrong_answer()]
=> END

~ Q2
Aetherion: The shadow of a building forms a right triangle. If its base is 50 ft and the angle of elevation is 45°, find the building’s height.  
- A. 22.0° => Q2_WRONG
- B. 22.5° => Q2_WRONG
- C. 23.5° => Q2_WRONG
- D. 50 ft => Q2_CORRECT

~ Q2_CORRECT
Aetherion: Balanced between earth and air. [do! DialogueManager.aetherion.trigger_correct_answer()]
=> Q3

~ Q2_WRONG
Aetherion: You gaze but see not. [do! DialogueManager.aetherion.trigger_wrong_answer()]
=> END

~ Q3
Aetherion: A drone hovers 500 m above ground, 1500 m away horizontally. What is the angle of depression to the observer?  
- A. 14.0° => Q3_WRONG
- B. 18.4° => Q3_CORRECT
- C. 36.8° => Q3_WRONG
- D. 71.6° => Q3_WRONG

~ Q3_CORRECT
Aetherion: You calculate as swiftly as wind! [do! DialogueManager.aetherion.trigger_correct_answer()]
=> Q4

~ Q3_WRONG
Aetherion: The gusts scatter your answer. [do! DialogueManager.aetherion.trigger_wrong_answer()]
=> END

~ Q4
Aetherion: If a ramp’s run is 18 m and its hypotenuse 20 m, find its angle of inclination.  
- A. 25.8° => Q4_WRONG
- B. 36.9° => Q4_CORRECT
- C. 41.4° => Q4_WRONG
- D. 64.2° => Q4_WRONG

~ Q4_CORRECT
Aetherion: Geometry bends before your mind. [do! DialogueManager.aetherion.trigger_correct_answer()]
=> Q5

~ Q4_WRONG
Aetherion: You stumble upon the slope. [do! DialogueManager.aetherion.trigger_wrong_answer()]
=> END

~ Q5
Aetherion: Which trigonometric ratio directly links height and distance in such ramps?  
- A. Tangent => Q5_CORRECT
- B. Sine => Q5_WRONG
- C. Cosine => Q5_WRONG
- D. Cosecant => Q5_WRONG

~ Q5_CORRECT
Aetherion: Excellent. The winds themselves applaud you. [do! DialogueManager.aetherion.trigger_death()]
[do! get_tree().get_first_node_in_group("player").unlock_player()]
[do! DialogueManager.aetherion.queue_free()]
=> END!

~ Q5_WRONG
Aetherion: The air grows still — you fail this ascent. [do! DialogueManager.aetherion.trigger_wrong_answer()]
=> END
